UPDATE "RareOpenerHit" SET "specialId" = 'os.taiki' WHERE "opener" = $t$Ugh, Taiki just doesn't #NoticeMyRivalry at all! She's so #PartyFun and her Texan burgers are so #Deliciousss... That's right! {user}, time to make some noise in UmaTube! Surely we can get a collab out of her! #MakeCurrenNoticeableAgain$t$;
UPDATE "RareOpenerHit" SET "specialId" = 'os.biko' WHERE "opener" = $t$Biko's got a new #UmaTokPost? Oh my GAWDDD I love Biko! Have you seen her animations? Her #PowerRanger series is also soooo cool... wait... You got me a #RangerCollab?! No weiii! (#PalmerHelios taught me that!) Thank you shooo much {user}! Time to get my #DressUp ready! #CurrenxBiko #PinkRanger$t$;
